.hero.main
  .container
    h2 Our Company
    h4.subtitle Building the future of development environments

.hero.people
  .container
    p.big
      | Nitrous is developed and maintained by an experienced team based out of San Francisco and Singapore. We focus on building the best tools for developers and teams around the world.

    ul
      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Scott has a deep knowledge of platforms and cloud computing with three successful startup exits - one in excess of $1b. He has managed teams at Microsoft, Salesforce and VMWare."
        img alt="Scott Collison" src="/images/company/collison.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="AJ loves baseball, surfing, and networked home appliances. He studied economics at Harvard and is obsessed with microformats"
        img alt="AJ" src="/images/company/solimine.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Pete started programming at the age of 8, when most kids were still picking their nose. He likes cycling and playing airsoft games"
        img alt="Pete" src="/images/company/pete.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Nicole is the glue that holds it all together at Nitrous. She enjoys designing clothes, animals of all kinds, and reading great books"
        img alt="Nicole" src="/images/company/nicole.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Chu Yeow likes: Miyo (his tortoiseshell cat), Japan, anime. Dislikes: trailing whitespace, tabs"
        img alt="Chu Yeow" src="/images/company/cheah.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Sunjin is a Level 90 Pandaren Ale-Drinker at Nitrous. He is able to code for multiple days without sleep as long as there is an uninterrupted supply of beer"
        img alt="Sunjin" src="/images/company/sunjin.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="Javier is an avid cyclist who likes to spin up servers and watch them run in graphs and metrics"
        img alt="Javier" src="/images/company/javier.png"

      li data-toggle="tooltip" title="This is YC. YC writes code in cloud. YC uses Nitrous. YC is smart. Be like YC."
        img alt="YC" src="/images/company/yc.png"

.hero.investors
  .container
    .row
      .col-xs-12.col-md-4
        img src='/images/company/bvp-logo.png' width='315px' height='80px' alt='Bessemer Venture Partners logo'
      .col-xs.12.col-md-8
        p
          | Bessemer Venture Partners led Nitrous' Seed and Series A financing rounds.
        p
          | Bessemer Venture Partners (BVP) invests in early-stage and hyper-growth startups, partnering closely with entrepreneurs to build durable businesses. With $4 billion under management, BVP invests anywhere from $100,000 to $75 million in innovative companies like Pinterest, Twilio, Box, LinkedIn, Shopify, Yelp, Skype and Nitrous. Over 100 BVP companies have gone public – in the last three years alone, BVP has had 46 exits (IPO and M&amp;A) and made new investments in more than 85 companies. Learn more at
          a href="http://www.bvp.com/" www.bvp.com

